blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6 ef34c3d534a16b140aef0643ed2fa36f8e9d1612\n\n### System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nEDIT: It's unrelated to the settings dialog. Project Manager does not load shortcuts properly and they get erased once settings are saved.\n\n___\n\nThe new Edit All Settings dialog in Project Manager will erase your shortcuts when the settings are saved. The reason is that shortcuts are registered all over the codebase, and most of the code that defines them does not run in Project Manager.\n\nThis might affect other settings too.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Assign an editor shortcut that doesn't exist in Project Manager (e.g. New Scene)\n2. Open Project Manager\n3. Open Settings -> Edit All Settings\n4. (optional?) Change any setting\n5. Open the editor again\n6. Check your previously assigned shortcut\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112814/reactions","